# Line endings (issues-log RN-07). Text files are stored and checked out with LF on every machine,
# whatever core.autocrlf says. A file already committed with CRLF is left as it is (text=auto does not
# renormalise it), so adding this file changes no diff; `git add --renormalize .` would convert them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Applied migrations are checksummed byte for byte (core.schema_migrations): never convert their line
# endings, or a database migrated from one checkout would refuse to start from another.
migrations/*.sql -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
*.onnx binary
